  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion (e.g., config_019) achieve high accuracy (63.9%). This experiment tests replacing ResNet50 with ViT (imagenet_vit_l) as the image encoder while retaining effective aggregation/fusion, isolating the impact of image encoder choice. It balances exploitation of proven methods with exploration of a potentially stronger encoder, addressing uncertainty about whether ViT outperforms ResNet50 in multimodal settings."  
